## IME configuration

The app defines a native Android IME service through:
- `app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`
- `app/src/main/res/xml/method.xml`
- `app/src/main/kotlin/com/keyboardx/app/ime/KeyboardIMEService.kt`

The IME is intentionally minimal and native. It does not yet include a full keyboard layout or advanced language logic.

## Future work

Planned work after Phase 3 stays out of scope for this task and includes:
